<title>USA: Mentor gets Canadian ok for liposuction.</title>
<headline>Mentor gets Canadian ok for liposuction.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mentor Corp said its new Contour Genesis Ultrasonic Assisted Liposuction system was approved by the Canadian Health Board for sale in Canada.</p>
<p>&quot;About a dozen countries have already approved our Contour System,&quot; said Christopher Conway, Chairman of Mentor.</p>
<p>Sales in the U.S. would begin later, following clinical trials and FDA approval, the company said.</p>
</text>
